description	"Rebel SpecForce Infiltrator

^2Weaponry:
- Silenced Pistol (1)
- Knife
-- ^5Cyan ^7/ ^4Blue ^7Styles
- Enhanced Strength (1)
- 2 Flashbang Grenades

^6Inventory:
- Advanced Medpac (50HP+)
- Cloak (2)

^8Attributes:
- Strong Against Melee
- Fast Hacking

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]
- 6 Tracking Darts ^3[CS2 Melee]

Rebel Infiltrators were among the most effective SpecForce divisions. They were chosen for their hatred of the Empire. They operated as secret agents and spies. They were also trained to slip through enemy lines and sow seeds of rebellion on Imperial worlds. "